{"id":"asesino","lemma":"asesino","pos":"noun","rank":460,"glosses":["murderer, killer (person who commits murder)","assassin","traitor"],"ipa":"/aseˈsino/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"asesinos","feminine":"asesina","femininePlural":"asesinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-asesino.wav","formAudio":{"asesina":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-asesina.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Eres un asesino.","en":"You're a murderer.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La policía anda detrás del asesino.","en":"The police are after the murderer.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"interjection to express…"},{"g":"behind, at the rear"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"El jardinero era el asesino.","en":"The gardener was the murderer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642319","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"gardener"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Puedo demostrar quién es el asesino.","en":"I can prove who the murderer is.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to show"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"«¡Eres un asesino!» «¡No, no lo soy!»","en":"\"You're a murderer!\" \"No, I'm not!\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687719","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"}]}]}